window.products.push({"id":158144,"name":"ORALNER 24“ Dual Zone Wine Fridge & Beverage Refrigerator Cooler, 18-Bottle & 57-Can Freestand Built-in for Beer Soda Drink, 2-in-1 w/Separate Temp Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yyh1F8RmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍻🍔【Dual Cooling Zones & Separate Temp Control】: Our 2-in-1 Dual Zone Wine Cooler Beverage Refrigerator features independent temperature controls to help chill your wines and beverages to the perfect temperature and provide you with the best taste. Beverages and wine have their own special room with a temperature range of 36°F to 50°F in the left zone and 41°F to 64°F in the right zone. 🍷🍇【Reliable Compressors for Fast Cooling】: This beverage refrigerator features an efficient, high-performance compressor cooling system that quickly delivers the perfect cooling temperature and is always protected from temperature fluctuations. The internal fan forced circulation works with the compressor to distribute the cool air evenly. The whole process is very quiet. 🥂🍊【Large Storage Capacity & 9 Removable Racks】: The left area of the wine and beverage refrigerator has 3 metal racks, which can hold 57 cans (12oz) of beverages, and the right area is equipped with 6 beech wood racks, which can hold 18 bottles of wine (750ml), which is enough to meet your daily needs and small gatherings. And the racks of our 2-in-1 beverage center are removable, giving you the freedom and flexibility to adjust the interior space according to the size of your drinks. 🥤🍓【Built-in or Freestanding for Multi-scene Use】: The versatile design with front vents allows the wine cooler to be used free standing or built into the counter, saving you valuable floor space. The 34.3\" height fits most standard counters and is ideal for installations such as kitchens, home offices or basement bars. Adjustable legs enhance its stability on the ground. Recommended embedded dimensions are 23.82” x 22.64” x 34.45” (W x D x H). ✨🍾【Digital Touch Control & Lockable Glass Doors】: Easy-to-use touch controls and digital displays make it easy to view and adjust the temperature of each chamber, and a switchable Fahrenheit and Celsius display makes it even easier. Visible glass doors and interior LED lights also help you clearly locate your beverages and wine and the interior lights can be turned on or off manually. The glass door can be locked with keys to prevent child from frequently opening the refrigerator.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yyh1F8RmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORALNER","source_asin":"B0B3JK77KB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3JK77KB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3JK77KB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
