window.products.push({"id":158203,"name":"ASOUNY Silicone Refrigerator Drip Catcher - Non-slip Cuttable Mini Fridge Drip Tray, Refrigerator Drip Tray Hide Stain, Fridge Spills Water Pad Catch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7119NVeaN2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Reusable High-Quality Material】Compared to the use of absorbent cloth water drip tray, our fridge water dispenser drip tray is made of silicone, which is anti-slip, and the design concept is to collect water drops rather than absorb water drops, only need to collect water drops before the full set can be dumped, there will be no long time use of cotton cloth will lead to mold problems. 【Cuttable Design】Our refrigerator drip catcher for water tray has been upgraded in the use of rectangular and semi-circular refrigerator slot can be used, with three sizes available on one refrigerator mat. You can easily cut it to fit your specific refrigerator model, whether it's a GE, Whirlpool, Samsung, or another brand. The flexible, elastic material provides cushioning and protection for delicate glassware too. 【Easy to Clean & Maintain】Cleaning and maintaining our water drip tray for refrigerator is a breeze - No need to wait for drying, just wash it in the dishwasher or rinse with water and wipe dry. Our high-quality material of refrigerator drip catcher for water tray is resistant to high temperatures, non-toxic, and rust-proof, ensuring long-lasting use. 【Free Your Hands】Tired of cleaning up water and mineral stains on your fridge drip tray? ASOUNY refrigerator water drip catcher pan can help you catch the drips or spills effectively from water dispenser. Water stains will not gather on the fridge tray and don't need to wipe it out anymore. No more hassle to make the refrigerator tray clean and tidy. 【Large Capacity】Refrigerator drip tray is raised on all sides and the liquid will not flow out when dripping. Fridge water drip catcher can catch a significant amount of water, thus keeping the water dispenser clean. There is any problem or defect with our product, we offer you an exchange or full refund at any time. If you have any questions, please contact us and we will serve you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7119NVeaN2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASOUNY","source_asin":"B0C5DKCXR8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5DKCXR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5DKCXR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
