window.products.push({"id":158563,"name":"6Ft Stainless Steel Washing Machine Hoses by Techecook - Burst Proof Hot and Cold Washer Hoses 6Ft - 2PACK - 6ft Washer Hoses Universal Fit to All Was","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Efhjy4MTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【2PACK 6FT WASHING MACHINE HOSES】:6FT stainless steel washer hoses contains a red hot water hose and a blue cold water hose. It is built to withstand full flow, preventing water leaks kinking crimping and corrosion. And the stainless steel washer hoses can be used in high and low temperature environments. Washing machine hoses 6ft 2 pack are made of high quality stainless steel materials and have been well tested by the manufacturer, easy and quick installation, saving your time and energy. ✔✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】:Including 1 x 6ft Blue colored for cold water, 1 x 6ft Red colored for hot water. The washer hoses body diameter is 0.512\", the inner diameter of the connection port is 0.986\". The 6FT washer hoses are made of 304 grade stainless steel braided, lead-free PVC core, which has good corrosion resistance and good oxidation resistance, extending the service life. Brass nuts, ferrules and nipples for superior corrosion resistance, it can effectively prevent rust and cracking. ✔✔【10-YEARS WARRANTY】:During the warranty period, if the straight 6ft washer hoses have any quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately. ▶Each connector of the 6ft washing machine hose is fitted with an extra-thick internal rubber washer to prevent leaks.The universal connector works on all standard washers, compatible 3/4\" NPT connections. ✔✔【COMPATIBLE MODEL】:The washing machine hoses 6ft 2 pack burstproof braided stainless steel suitable for all washers-the flexible universal washing machine hoses can be easily connected to the ordinary household water supply line in the laundry room. Both washing machine hoses for an easy and smooth installation in tight spaces, relieving strain on the hose. And the 6ft stainless steel washing machine supply lines work well in both high and low temperatures, ranging from 15°F to 158°F. ✔✔【DIY INSTALLATION】:Disconnect the power before installing this washer hoses. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. Install the washing machine hose is very simple. The installation needs to use wrench. You can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install it, saving you hundreds of dollars over calling in a repairman to fix it! The 6ft washing machine hoses are color-coded to ensure easy matching of hot to hot and cold to cold from the water supply faucet to the washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Efhjy4MTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B0BQR43BWL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQR43BWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQR43BWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
