window.products.push({"id":158618,"name":"Ozeri Touch III Kitchen Scale in Tempered Glass, 22 lbs (10 kg), Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lP791GWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunction kitchen scale combines precision weighing technology with a built-in 12/24-hour Clock, Timer, Temperature (F and C) & Humidity Gauge. Boasts an ultra-modern design with a large (7” x 9”) glass weighing platform, wall-mount notches and a retractable kickstand for easy storage. Large high-contrast LCD displays results in ounces, pounds, grams, milliliters and fluid ounces and features touch-sensitive Unit and Tare buttons for effortless operation. Equipped with high-precision sensors that weigh from 0.1 oz to 22 lbs / 1 g to 10 kg in units of 0.1 oz or 1 g. Continuously displays clock and weather data in a low-power state, and runs on 4 included AAA batteries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lP791GWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozeri","source_asin":"B0B8GJCLBS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8GJCLBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8GJCLBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
