window.products.push({"id":158700,"name":"Kobe Seamless RA2830SB Stainless Steel Under Cabinet Range Hood with 760 CFM Internal Blower - 30 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612VbuwpJQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Kobe Stainless Steel Standard Hood Hood Range Hood RA2830SB. Powerful motor with low speed of 420 CFM (2.0 sones) and high speed of 760 CFM (4.5 sones). The hood body is concealed inside the cabinets, so all you see is a slim 2-inch trim. Simple three-switch system - On/Off switch, Low/High Speed switch, and a Light switch. KOBE's unique design allows for cleaning the fans without disassembling the hood. 2 dishwasher-safe baffle filters catch oil and grease. Quality parts are checked for defects and designed for trouble free long term use. Easy to install innovative design for installation under the cabinet only. 18-Gauge Seamless Commercial Steel. 2 bright 12-volt 20-watt halogen lights. 2 speed controls. Width: 29 3/4. Depth: 19 5/8. Height: 2. Exhaust Duct: 6. Weight: 33. Motor Type: Squirrel Cage. Voltage: 120V/60Hz. Max dB: 62. Max Sones: 4.5. Max CFM: 760. Kobe Range Hoods is a leader in quiet kitchen ventilation. KOBE kitchen ventilation products are designed by Tosho & Company, Ltd., their parent company in Japan. Tosho & Company, Ltd. has been in the business of selling quality products in Japan and globally for over 40 years. KOBE Range Hoods is recognized for providing top quality kitchen ventilation products in the United States, as well as Canada. Their goal is to design kitchen ventilation products with innovative styles, pioneering technology at an attractive price. The result of KOBE's extensive research and development is a series of kitchen ventilation products that are seamless, elegant, powerful, and possess a very unique feature, the QuietMode technology. This famous and remarkable QuietMode feature allows you to operate your range hood without the irritation of fan noise while cooking and entertaining in the kitchen. The importance of noise reduction is evident in the Kobe motto: So Quiet...You Won't Believe It's On!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612VbuwpJQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kobe","source_asin":"B0019MLMQ4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0019MLMQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0019MLMQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":158701,"name":"HOMCOM Electric Small Compact Portable Washer Washing Machine, for Dorms, College Rooms, RV's - Blue and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611PVDm6hPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Dirty clothes taking over your room? This compact washing machine from HomCom is perfect for doing laundry in small spaces including dorms, apartments, RVs, hotels, etc. The electric portable washing machine has an 8.4 lbs load capacity for doing medium laundry loads. Make doing laundry a breeze! Simply put your clothes in the basket, fill with water, set the timer and let the machine do the work. With the control timer, you can wash or dry clothes for up to 15 minutes. The stainless steel basket doubles as a portable spin dryer that uses air motion and not heat and the drainage tube allows you to drain the dirty water with ease. This RV washing machine is a great laundry alternative! Features: Features:- 2-in-1 function which can be used as a washing machine and spin dryer - Compact size is great for dorms, apartments, motorhomes, etc. - Features a 8.4 lbs load capacity for medium laundry loads - Durable stainless steel dehydration basket - Wash and dry up to 15 minutes with the control timer - Features a drainage tube to easily drain out dirty water - Handle is designed for easy open - Uses air motion to dry without heat Specifications: Specifications:- Color: Blue and White - Material: PP, Stainless Steel - Overall Dimensions: 16.5\" L x 14.25\" W x 26\" H - Voltage: 120V/60Hz - Power: 250W - Minimum Water Level: 0.8 cu ft - Maximum Water Level: 1.2 cu ft - Wire Length: 63\" L - Inlet Pipe Length 45.5\" L - Washing Capacity: 8.4 lbs - Net Weight: 15.4 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611PVDm6hPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCOM","source_asin":"B0791G17WR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0791G17WR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0791G17WR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":158702,"name":"WH23X10030 AP5803461 Washer Drain Pump by Techecook - Compatible for GE Washing Machine - Replacement for WH23X10013 WH23X0081 WH23X0091 WH23X0092 P58","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511mq53eW-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【WH23X10030 DRAIN PUMP】WH23x10030 ge washer drain pump removes water from the washer during the drain portion of the cycle, and is activated after the spin speed is maintained for a specific period of time. The WH23x10030 drain pump is located at the front right corner of the base of the washer. AP5803461 ge drain pump is made of high quality durable metal and ABS material for extended service life ✔✔【WIDE COMPATIBLE】WH23x10030 washer drain pump compatible with GE Hotpoint washing machine. ►Washer pump wh23x10030 replaces : J27-769, TRUCK, TRUCK-1, WH23X0081, WH23X0091, WH23X0092, WH23X10003, WH23X10013, WH23X8081, WH23X81, WH23X91, WH23X92, 3015301, AP5803461, PS271333, EAP271333, DP035-025, 175D3834P004, etc. If you are not sure that your washer can fit the WH23x10030 ge washing machine pump, please contact us ✔✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】Including 1 x WH23X10030 Washer Drain Pump motor assembly with mounting bracket. SPECIFICATIONS:120V-127V 60Hz 85W 1.4A 45L/Min. WH23x10030 ge washer drain pump can fixes the following symptoms: ①Will not drain ②Leaking ③Pumps but will not spin ④Noisy ⑤ Propeller or motor goes bad ⑥The body cracks ✔✔【365 DAYS WARRANTY】During the 365 days warranty period, if the WH23X10030 AP5803461 washer drain pump has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately. We will try our best to solve the problem. Amazon official logistics, your products will have a strong logistics guarantee ✔✔【DIY INSTALLATION】Please disconnect the power and water before installing WH23x10030 washer drain pump for ge, and wear work gloves to protect your hands. The installation needs to use a putty knife, Phillips and flat blade screw driver, 1/4 inch nut driver, and needle nose pliers. You can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install it,as there were plenty of do it yourself videos on there that helped guide you on the repair","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511mq53eW-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B0BJDDTPF7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJDDTPF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJDDTPF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
