window.products.push({"id":158932,"name":"Mother Hen's 12 Eggs (3 x 4) Wooden Egg Holder - Wooden Egg Tray - Egg Holder Countertop - Egg Tray For Refrigerator","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tdwVXWIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a modern alternative to the old boring plastic egg tray or carton? Beautifully crafted from rustic style eco-friendly rubber wood, these reusable egg trays are a great addition to any modern kitchen and home Hold fresh chicken / duck / quail eggs, boiled eggs, deviled eggs, herbs & spices, or salt & pepper. You can even hold desserts for the kids and parties! These egg holders are lightweight, easy to clean, and can be stored in the fridge, drawer, or anywhere around your house so you can easily access when you bake or make your favorite recipes. You can also take it with you on holidays or camping! Bring life to your kitchen countertop with this stylish alternative to the old boring plastic tray, carton, basket, crate, box, or storage container. Designed with curved edges and carrying grooves underneath so it easily places inside the refrigerator, and the perfect spacing between the eggs helps prevent annoying cracked eggshells Eco-friendly Made from rubber wood: Currently, rubber plantation trees are generally harvested for wood after they complete the latex producing cycle, when they are 25 to 30 years old. When the latex yields become extremely low, the trees are then felled, and new trees are usually planted. This makes rubber wood 'eco-friendly' in that the wood is harvested from a renewable source What's included? - 12 holes wooden egg tray (note: suits standard large & extra large eggs, but may not suit jumbo eggs) - Gift wrapping (as pictured) - Box packaging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tdwVXWIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mother Hen's","source_asin":"B08KWMWMKZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KWMWMKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KWMWMKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
