window.products.push({"id":158957,"name":"LA-1044 Heating Element and LA-1053 Dryer Thermal Fuse Kit by SupHomie - Compatible with Whirlpool Magic Chef Dryers Replaces LA1044 AP4242494 PS21622","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wkn3pGKHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part number: LA-1044 LA-1044 heating element generates the heat for drying clothes. The LA1044 element rated at 4750 Watts at 240 Volts, it has 2 male 1/4\" spade terminals. Part number: LA-1053 LA-1053 dryer thermal fuse kit replacement comes with three separate thermal fuses for dryers. 1 electric thermal fuse with a limit at 258°F, 1 gas thermal fuse with a limit at 240°F and 1 gas and electric high limit thermostat with a limit at 300°F. The thermal fuse kit shuts off the motor in the dryer when it begins to overheat. If the dryer will not heat, is overheated, shuts off too soon, or takes too long to dry then the thermal fuse might have exploded and need to be replaced. Works with most top name brands: Whirlpool, Jenn Air, Amana, Magic-Chef, Montgomery Wards, Crosley, Admiral, Norge. Easy to install: Before you begin your repair, make sure to disconnect the power from the dryer.The tools you will need for this repair include a putty knife, a quarter-inch nut driver, and a pair of needle nose pliers. You also can watch installation video, install the part by yourself and quickly get your dryer back to work. Fix Problems: No heat or not enough heat Takes too long to dry Will not Start Too hot Package list: 1 x LA-1044 Dryer Heating Element 1 x LA-1053 Dryer Thermal Fuse Kit Choose our LA1044 heating element and LA1053 thermal fuse to save your time and money now! The Whirlpool brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Whirlpool brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wkn3pGKHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SupHomie","source_asin":"B09F3MCJC9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-158957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F3MCJC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F3MCJC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
